flowchart TB
  caller[Existing CLI names and scheduler callers] --> main
  subgraph reporter[Current private functions in factory-reporter-v5.mjs]
    main[main: parse / config / endpoint / dispatch]
    main --> preview[previewReport: validate and show]
    main --> enqueue[enqueueReport: local acceptance]
    main --> flush[flushReports: setup / lock / JSON / exit]
    flush --> queue[flushQueue: expire / visit / apply action / count]
    queue --> post[Existing postOne: one delivery decision]
    post --> completion[Existing complete: supplied ACK then delete action]
    post --> retain[Existing retainFailure: keep or hold]
    completion --> queue
    retain --> queue
    queue --> outcome[Existing counters object]
    outcome --> flush
    preview --> readPort[Existing WIRE.readReport / v9 keeps Rabbit gate]
    enqueue --> readPort
  end
  post --> deps[Existing fragment / controlled gate / runtime ACK modules]
  readPort -- v5 to v8 --> readers
  readPort -- v9 --> rabbit[Existing Rabbit reader and validation / unchanged]
  other[Existing legacy and current callers] --> readers
  subgraph contract[Current private helper in contract.mjs]
    readers[Eight existing public async report readers]
    readers --> read[readValidatedReport: file / UTF8 / JSON]
    read --> validators[Existing per-wire validators]
    validators --> original[Return original bytes and report to caller]
  end
  note[No new module / export / CLI / configuration]
